silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_02_enrichment_by_type_information_concrete_anchor_5#itis_tsn_183798_taxrow a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.01_orientation.chapters.14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline.sections.02_enrichment_by_type_information.concrete_anchor_5#itis_tsn_183798_taxrow" .
silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_02_enrichment_by_type_information_concrete_anchor_5#itis_tsn_183798_taxrow silm:hasLongDescription "The ITIS_TSN_183798_TaxRow is TaxRow_TSN183798 is the ITIS taxonomy row for Felis catus (the species; TSN 183798 in the ITIS database). It is the target of the taxonomy leg lambda_tax: Mittens -> TaxRow_TSN183798. The row carries the scientific-name string, the rank \"Species\", the parent taxon TSN 552349 (Felis), and the validation status \"valid\". It is a source leg into D_Mittens for the taxonomy contribution; it is NOT equal to Mittens, NOT equal to DomesticCat, and is preserved as a negative-regression baseline against catus-collision." .
